<title>ESTONIA: PENNU'S PROFIT FALLS IN Q1.</title>
<headline>PENNU'S PROFIT FALLS IN Q1.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pennu Computer Technology Company said on Monday that its first quarter pre-tax profit was two million kroons.</p>
<p>This compared with a profit of 2.9 million kroons for the fourth quarter of 1996. Figures for the first quarter of 1996 were not available.</p>
<p>The company's net turnover decreased from 51.9 million kroons in the fourth quarter of 1996 to 37.8 million kroons for the first quarter of 1997, the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
